# Visual Studio / .NET Core common ignores
## Build folders
bin/
obj/
publish/

## User-specific files
.vs/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.DotSettings.user

## Rider
.idea/

## NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg
.nuget/

## EF Core local DB files (ignore local DB files but keep migrations folder)
*.db
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.sqlite

## ASP.NET / IIS
logs/
wwwroot/uploads/

## Secrets / local configuration
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*

## Certificates
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key

## Test results
TestResults/
coverage/
*.trx

## Publishing
*.publishsettings

## Packages and cache
node_modules/
bower_components/

## OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp

# Docker
docker-compose.override.yml

# Keep migrations tracked (do not ignore Migrations/)
# If you want to ignore automatic EF migrations artifacts, adjust accordingly
